    "coreTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "朱鸢在[压制模式]下，消耗[强化霰弹]进行攻击时，招式造成的伤害提升40%，攻击处于失衡状态下的敌人时，该增益效果额外提升40%；进入战场时，朱鸢立刻获得6枚[强化霰弹]。"
    },
    "additionalAbilityTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "队伍中存在[支援]角色或与自身阵营相同的角色时触发：\n朱鸢发动[强化特殊技]、[连携技]或[终结技]时，自身暴击率提升30%，持续10秒。"
    },
    "cinemaTexts": [
      {
        "en": "When Zhu Yuan activates Chain Attacks/Ultimates, gain the Quick Reload effect. When Zhu Yuan has the Quick Reload effect and uses up all Enhanced Shotshells, the Quick Reload effect will be consumed to instantly gain 6/9 Enhanced Shotshells.",
        "zh-CN": "朱鸢发动[连携技]/[终结技]时，将获得[快速装填]效果；当朱鸢拥有[快速装填]效果时，耗尽所有[强化霰弹]后，将消耗[快速装填]效果，立刻获得6/9枚[强化霰弹]。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In Suppressive Mode, Zhu Yuan's Anti-Interrupt level is increased and DMG taken reduced by 10%. When Zhu Yuan hits an enemy with Enhanced Shotshells, deal 10% more Basic Attack: Please Do Not Resist and Dash Attack: Overwhelming Firepower Ether DMG, stacking up to 5 times and lasting for 5s. Each shot adds one stack of this effect, and repeated triggers reset the duration.",
        "zh-CN": "[压制模式]下，朱鸢的抗打断等级提升，受到伤害降低10%；消耗[强化霰弹]攻击命中敌人时，[普通攻击：请勿抵抗]与[冲刺攻击：火力压制]造成的以太伤害提升10%，最多叠加5层，持续5秒，每次开火最多获得一层效果，重复触发时刷新持续时间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Zhu Yuan hits an enemy with Enhanced Shotshells, her Basic Attack: Please Do Not Resist and Dash Attack: Overwhelming Firepower ignore 25% of the target's Ether RES.",
        "zh-CN": "朱鸢消耗[强化霰弹]攻击命中敌人时，[普通攻击：请勿抵抗]与[冲刺攻击：火力压制]无视目标25%以太伤害抗性。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Zhu Yuan consumes a total of 12 Enhanced Shotshells, she receives the Ether Afterglow effect, and the Energy cost of the next EX Special Attack is reduced by 30. Launching an EX Special Attack will consume Ether Afterglow and shoot an additional 4-bullet Ether Buckshot. Each extra bullet deals DMG equal to 220% of Zhu Yuan's ATK.",
        "zh-CN": "朱鸢累计消耗12枚[强化霰弹]时，将获得[以太余温]效果，并使下次发动的[强化特殊技]能量消耗降低30点；发动[强化特殊技]时，将消耗[以太余温]效果，额外发射总计4枚以太鹿弹，每枚额外发射的以太鹿弹将造成朱鸢220%攻击力的伤害。"
      }
    ]
  }
